"y": 2023, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}, {"id": 516652, "date": 1694995200, "platform": 14, "y": 2023, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}, {"id": 516654, "date": 1694995200, "platform": 49, "y": 2023, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}, {"id": 482075, "date": 1695081600, "platform": 167, "y": 2023, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}, {"id": 482074, "date": 1695081600, "platform": 48, "y": 2023, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 451376, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc9oa8.jpg"}, {"id": 451375, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc9oa7.jpg"}, {"id": 451377, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc9oa9.jpg"}, {"id": 451379, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc9oab.jpg"}, {"id": 451378, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc9oaa.jpg"}], "slug": "lies-of-p", "storyline": "Lies of P is set in the late 19th Century to the early 20th Century of the Belle \u00c9poque Era in Europe within a city called Krat. The city of Krat was once a beautiful place but has now become lost and turned into a living hell that is filled with unspeakable horrors due to a deadly plague. Krat is featured as a grim city where multiple automatons now roam almost every part of the center, from the streets, rooftops, alleyways, and within buildings.\n\nAs you start your adventure in Lies of P, you play as the puppet mechanoid Pinocchio who awakens in an abandoned train station not knowing where he has come from and what his purpose is. As we all know the famous fable of Pinocchio, Mr. Geppetto carved a wooden puppet named Pinocchio and was visited by the Blue Fairy who granted Mr. Geppetto's wish by transforming the puppet into a living being, that being said, Pinocchio sets forth into reaching his goal of becoming a real boy.", "summary": "Lies of P is an action role-playing game set in a dark, Belle \u00c9poque-inspired city overrun by deadly puppets. Players control Pinocchio, reimagined as a mechanical warrior, navigating a decaying world while making choices that affect the unfolding narrative. The game features challenging melee combat, weapon customization, and a mechanical arm with various abilities.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/lies-of-p", "videos": [{"id": 49512, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "qKceAv6N8iE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qKceAv6N8iE", "title": "Lies of P - Story Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/qKceAv6N8iE/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 73665, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "s3PfHlrh0GE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s3PfHlrh0GE", "title": "Lies of P - Gameplay Reveal", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/s3PfHlrh0GE/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 73703, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "BID72hSKasc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BID72hSKasc", "title": "Lies Of P World Premiere Trailer | gamescom Opening Night LIVE 2022", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BID72hSKasc/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 73828, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "PKP18vFW83A", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PKP18vFW83A", "title": "Lies of P - 12 Minutes of Gameplay | gamescom 2022", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/PKP18vFW83A/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 73831, "name": "Presentation", "video_id": "7mru_M370uU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7mru_M370uU", "title": "Lies of P Full Presentation | gamescom 2022 Xbox Booth", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7mru_M370uU/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 84625, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "3JQKNZ0e9vg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3JQKNZ0e9vg", "title": "Lies of P - Official Release Window Trailer | IGN Fan Fest 2023", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3JQKNZ0e9vg/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 84626, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": 